Pocket 3 zoom now offers only the stops the recording FORMAT allows, with a short note naming the new cap, and the readout no longer holds a value the camera refused. Shutter, ISO, zoom and ND use a fixed number format, so a phone language with decimal commas no longer shows odd values. HDR display (Operator Setup → Display) brightens the phone panel; off by default, and screen recording stays a normal SDR picture. Also fixes a start-up failure on Android 15 and newer.
